                     "Att vara bestialisk, omänsklig"@sv ;
    solid-memo:back "잔혹하다"@ko ;
    solid-memo:backNote "그 영화는 너무 잔혹해서 끝까지 못 봤어요. — That movie was so brutally cruel that I couldn't watch it to the end."@en ,
